<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ошибка — ВосканАвто</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
<style>
:root{--primary:#2563eb;--primary-dark:#1d4ed8;--gray:#64748b;--gray-light:#f1f5f9;--white:#fff;--radius:12px}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:#f8fafc;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.error-container{text-align:center;padding:40px;max-width:400px}
.error-icon{font-size:80px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:24px;opacity:.5}
.error-container h1{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b;margin-bottom:12px}
.error-container p{color:var(--gray);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:24px;line-height:1.6}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s}
.btn-primary{background:var(--primary);color:white}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--primary-dark)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="error-container">
<div class="error-icon"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i></div>
<h1>Ошибка</h1>
<p><%= message || 'Что-то пошло не так. Попробуйте позже.' %></p>
<a href="/" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> На главную</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
